{
  "format": "opensculptboy/vrm-expressions@1",
  "description": "VRM expressions as mixes of Anny's ARKit facial actions (model.facial_action_labels; Left and Right are the avatar's own sides). presets: the VRM 1.0 presets, in the order of the file; vrm0Preset names the VRM 0.x preset (null makes a 0.x custom group), and vrm0Name names the 0.x group. perfectSync: one custom per facial action, named in PascalCase (EyeBlinkLeft). customs: further customs; versions limits them to some VRM versions (the VSeeFace visemes exist in VRM 0.x files only). Every weight lies in [0, 1]. test/test_vrm_expressions.py measures the visemes on the mesh.",
  "presets": {
    "aa": {
      "mix": {"jawOpen": 0.42, "mouthLowerDownLeft": 0.3, "mouthLowerDownRight": 0.3, "mouthUpperUpLeft": 0.15, "mouthUpperUpRight": 0.15, "mouthStretchLeft": 0.1, "mouthStretchRight": 0.1},
      "vrm0Preset": "a", "vrm0Name": "A"
    },
    "ih": {
